  </p></section><div data-omtr-component-type="local-stories" data-omtr-component-title="Latest Stories from North Carolina" data-omtr-component-position="3" data-omtr-component-region="main-content" data-omtr-component-item-count="4" data-fetch-key="LocalStories:0" class="local-stories"><div class="collection collection-river"><header class="heading"><h2 class="title"><span>Latest Stories from North Carolina</span></h2></header> <div class="content article-list"><article data-omtr-item-position="1" data-omtr-item-type="article" data-omtr-item-title="Steve Bender: Reflecting on Hurricane Helene 2 years later from a place close to home" class="article story-1"><div class="m"><a href="https://www.foxweather.com/weather-news/steve-bender-reflecting-hurricane-helene-two-years-later" data-omtr-intcmp="fxw_local-forecast_local-forecast_main-content_local-stories_latest-stories-from-north-carolina_3_1_media"><picture><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/09/343/192/img_3104-scaled.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/09/686/384/img_3104-scaled.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x" width="343" height="192"><source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/09/213/120/img_3104-scaled.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/09/426/240/img_3104-scaled.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x" width="213" height="120"> <img src="https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/09/213/120/img_3104-scaled.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1" alt="Steve Bender: Reflecting on Hurricane Helene 2 years later from a place close to home" width="213" height="120" loading="lazy"></picture></a></div> <div class="info"><!----> <header class="info-header"><!----> <h2 class="title"><a href="https://www.foxweather.com/weather-news/steve-bender-reflecting-hurricane-helene-two-years-later" data-omtr-intcmp="fxw_local-forecast_local-forecast_main-content_local-stories_latest-stories-from-north-carolina_3_1">
          Steve Bender: Reflecting on Hurricane Helene 2 years later from a place close to home
        </a></h2> <p class="dek">
        There are places you cover as a meteorologist that you know you'll remember. Then there are places that become part of you. For Steve Bender, western North Carolina is one of those places.
      </p> <div class="meta"><!----> <!----></div></header></div></article> <!----><article data-omtr-item-position="2" data-omtr-item-type="article" data-omtr-item-title="Nor’easter batters East Coast with flooding and dangerous surf — here’s where impacts are the worst" class="article story-2"><div class="m"><a href="https://www.foxweather.com/weather-news/east-coast-communities-noreaster-worst-impacts" data-omtr-intcmp="fxw_local-forecast_local-forecast_main-content_local-stories_latest-stories-from-north-carolina_3_2_media"><picture><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/09/343/192/gettyimages-2296763309.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/09/686/384/gettyimages-2296763309.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x" width="343" height="192"><source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/09/213/120/gettyimages-2296763309.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/09/426/240/gettyimages-2296763309.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x" width="213" height="120"> <img src="https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/09/213/120/gettyimages-2296763309.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1" alt="Nor’easter batters East Coast with flooding and dangerous surf — here’s where impacts are the worst" width="213" height="120" loading="lazy"></picture></a></div> <div class="info"><!----> <header class="info-header"><!----> <h2 class="title"><a href="https://www.foxweather.com/weather-news/east-coast-communities-noreaster-worst-impacts" data-omtr-intcmp="fxw_local-forecast_local-forecast_main-content_local-stories_latest-stories-from-north-carolina_3_2">
          Nor’easter batters East Coast with flooding and dangerous surf — here’s where impacts are the worst
        </a></h2> <p class="dek">
        The first nor’easter of the fall has arrived and is packing a punch for over 40 million Americans this weekend, bringing dangerous storm conditions to the East Coast.
      </p> <div class="meta"><!----> <!----></div></header></div></article> <!----><article data-omtr-item-position="3" data-omtr-item-type="article" data-omtr-item-title="Timeline: Where and when you will see impacts from the strengthening nor'easter this weekend" class="article story-3"><div class="m"><a href="https://www.foxweather.com/weather-news/timeline-where-when-major-us-cities-impacts-noreaster" data-omtr-intcmp="fxw_local-forecast_local-forecast_main-content_local-stories_latest-stories-from-north-carolina_3_3_media"><picture><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/08/343/192/screenshot-2026-08-31-184407.png?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/08/686/384/screenshot-2026-08-31-184407.png?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x" width="343" height="192"><source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/08/213/120/screenshot-2026-08-31-184407.png?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/08/426/240/screenshot-2026-08-31-184407.png?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x" width="213" height="120"> <img src="https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/08/213/120/screenshot-2026-08-31-184407.png?ve=1&amp;tl=1" alt="Timeline: Where and when you will see impacts from the strengthening nor'easter this weekend" width="213" height="120" loading="lazy"></picture></a></div> <div class="info"><!----> <header class="info-header"><!----> <h2 class="title"><a href="https://www.foxweather.com/weather-news/timeline-where-when-major-us-cities-impacts-noreaster" data-omtr-intcmp="fxw_local-forecast_local-forecast_main-content_local-stories_latest-stories-from-north-carolina_3_3">
          Timeline: Where and when you will see impacts from the strengthening nor'easter this weekend
        </a></h2> <p class="dek">
        A strengthening nor'easter is threatening millions as it begins its charge up the East Coast, lashing North Carolina's Outer Banks and the Mid-Atlantic coast with more intense wind, severe beach erosion and high tide flooding.
      </p> <div class="meta"><!----> <!----></div></header></div></article> <!----><article data-omtr-item-position="4" data-omtr-item-type="article" data-omtr-item-title="Watch: Intensifying nor'easter slams East Coast with violent surf and coastal flooding as worst still to come" class="article story-4"><div class="m"><a href="https://www.foxweather.com/extreme-weather/noreaster-slams-mid-atlantic-region-northeast-intense-winds-rough-waves-coastal-flooding" data-omtr-intcmp="fxw_local-forecast_local-forecast_main-content_local-stories_latest-stories-from-north-carolina_3_4_media"><picture><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/09/343/192/screenshot-2026-09-24-172526.png?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/09/686/384/screenshot-2026-09-24-172526.png?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x" width="343" height="192"><source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/09/213/120/screenshot-2026-09-24-172526.png?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/09/426/240/screenshot-2026-09-24-172526.png?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x" width="213" height="120"> <img src="https://images.foxweather.com/static.foxweather.com/www.foxweather.com/content/uploads/2026/09/213/120/screenshot-2026-09-24-172526.png?ve=1&amp;tl=1" alt="Watch: Intensifying nor'easter slams East Coast with violent surf and coastal flooding as worst still to come" width="213" height="120" loading="lazy"></picture></a></div> <div class="info"><!----> <header class="info-header"><!----> <h2 class="title"><a href="https://www.foxweather.com/extreme-weather/noreaster-slams-mid-atlantic-region-northeast-intense-winds-rough-waves-coastal-flooding" data-omtr-intcmp="fxw_local-forecast_local-forecast_main-content_local-stories_latest-stories-from-north-carolina_3_4">
          Watch: Intensifying nor'easter slams East Coast with violent surf and coastal flooding as worst still to come
        </a></h2> <p class="dek">
        America's first fall nor’easter is strengthening in the Atlantic Ocean, and millions along the East Coast have already faced days of coastal flooding, huge surf and vicious winds with the storm's worst impacts still to come.
