002F4060-Granite-Ridge-Trl-27616\u002Fhome\u002F192600754",streetName:"4060 Granite Ridge Trl",fullAddress:"4060 Granite Ridge Trl, Raleigh, NC 27616",mlsId:"10195850"}]},"LocalStories:0":{articles:[{title:"Steve Bender: Reflecting on Hurricane Helene 2 years later from a place close to home",url:"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fweather-news\u002Fsteve-bender-reflecting-hurricane-helene-two-years-later",category:{label:W,url:au},eyebrowType:a,publishTime:a,description:"There are places you cover as a meteorologist that you know you'll remember. Then there are places that become part of you. For Steve Bender, western North Carolina is one of those places.",componentType:X,duration:a,image:{src:"https:\u002F\u002Fimages.foxweather.com\u002Fstatic.foxweather.com\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fcontent\u002Fuploads\u002F2026\u002F09\u002F213\u002F120\u002Fimg_3104-scaled.jpg?ve=1&tl=1",width:t,height:u,sourceSet:[{src:"https:\u002F\u002Fimages.foxweather.com\u002Fstatic.foxweather.com\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fcontent\u002Fuploads\u002F2026\u002F09\u002F343\u002F192\u002Fimg_3104-scaled.jpg?ve=1&tl=1, https:\u002F\u002Fimages.foxweather.com\u002Fstatic.foxweather.com\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fcontent\u002Fuploads\u002F2026\u002F09\u002F686\u002F384\u002Fimg_3104-scaled.jpg?ve=1&tl=1 2x",media:Y,width:Z,height:D},{src:"https:\u002F\u002Fimages.foxweather.com\u002Fstatic.foxweather.com\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fcontent\u002Fuploads\u002F2026\u002F09\u002F213\u002F120\u002Fimg_3104-scaled.jpg?ve=1&tl=1, https:\u002F\u002Fimages.foxweather.com\u002Fstatic.foxweather.com\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fcontent\u002Fuploads\u002F2026\u002F09\u002F426\u002F240\u002Fimg_3104-scaled.jpg?ve=1&tl=1 2x",media:_,width:t,height:u}]},isLiveBlog:g},{title:"Nor’easter batters East Coast with flooding and dangerous surf — here’s where impacts are the worst",url:"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fweather-news\u002Feast-coast-communities-noreaster-worst-impacts",category:{label:W,url:au},eyebrowType:a,publishTime:a,description:"The first nor’easter of the fall has arrived and is packing a punch for over 40 million Americans this weekend, bringing dangerous storm conditions to the East Coast.",componentType:X,duration:a,image:{src:"https:\u002F\u002Fimages.foxweather.com\u002Fstatic.foxweather.com\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fcontent\u002Fuploads\u002F2026\u002F09\u002F213\u002F120\u002Fgettyimages-2296763309.jpg?ve=1&tl=1",width:t,height:u,sourceSet:[{src:"https:\u002F\u002Fimages.foxweather.com\u002Fstatic.foxweather.com\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fcontent\u002Fuploads\u002F2026\u002F09\u002F343\u002F192\u002Fgettyimages-2296763309.jpg?ve=1&tl=1, https:\u002F\u002Fimages.foxweather.com\u002Fstatic.foxweather.com\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fcontent\u002Fuploads\u002F2026\u002F09\u002F686\u002F384\u002Fgettyimages-2296763309.jpg?ve=1&tl=1 2x",media:Y,width:Z,height:D},{src:"https:\u002F\u002Fimages.foxweather.com\u002Fstatic.foxweather.com\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fcontent\u002Fuploads\u002F2026\u002F09\u002F213\u002F120\u002Fgettyimages-2296763309.jpg?ve=1&tl=1, https:\u002F\u002Fimages.foxweather.com\u002Fstatic.foxweather.com\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fcontent\u002Fuploads\u002F2026\u002F09\u002F426\u002F240\u002Fgettyimages-2296763309.jpg?ve=1&tl=1 2x",media:_,width:t,height:u}]},isLiveBlog:g},{title:"Timeline: Where and when you will see impacts from the strengthening nor'easter this weekend",url:"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fweather-news\u002Ftimeline-where-when-major-us-cities-impacts-noreaster",category:{label:W,url:au},eyebrowType:a,publishTime:a,description:"A strengthening nor'easter is threatening millions as it begins its charge up the East Coast, lashing North Carolina's Outer Banks and the Mid-Atlantic coast with more intense wind, severe beach erosion and high tide flooding.",componentType:X,duration:a,image:{src:"https:\u002F\u002Fimages.foxweather.com\u002Fstatic.foxweather.com\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fcontent\u002Fuploads\u002F2026\u002F08\u002F213\u002F120\u002Fscreenshot-2026-08-31-184407.png?ve=1&tl=1",width:t,height:u,sourceSet:[{src:"https:\u002F\u002Fimages.foxweather.com\u002Fstatic.foxweather.com\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fcontent\u002Fuploads\u002F2026\u002F08\u002F343\u002F192\u002Fscreenshot-2026-08-31-184407.png?ve=1&tl=1, https:\u002F\u002Fimages.foxweather.com\u002Fstatic.foxweather.com\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fcontent\u002Fuploads\u002F2026\u002F08\u002F686\u002F384\u002Fscreenshot-2026-08-31-184407.png?ve=1&tl=1 2x",media:Y,width:Z,height:D},{src:"https:\u002F\u002Fimages.foxweather.com\u002Fstatic.foxweather.com\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fcontent\u002Fuploads\u002F2026\u002F08\u002F213\u002F120\u002Fscreenshot-2026-08-31-184407.png?ve=1&tl=1, https:\u002F\u002Fimages.foxweather.com\u002Fstatic.foxweather.com\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fcontent\u002Fuploads\u002F2026\u002F08\u002F426\u002F240\u002Fscreenshot-2026-08-31-184407.png?ve=1&tl=1 2x",media:_,width:t,height:u}]},isLiveBlog:g},{title:"Watch: Intensifying nor'easter slams East Coast with violent surf and coastal flooding as worst still to come",url:"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fextreme-weather\u002Fnoreaster-slams-mid-atlantic-region-northeast-intense-winds-rough-waves-coastal-flooding",category:{label:G,url:O},eyebrowType:a,publishTime:a,description:"America's first fall nor’easter is strengthening in the Atlantic Ocean, and millions along the East Coast have already faced days of coastal flooding, huge surf and vicious winds with the storm's worst impacts still to come.",componentType:X,duration:a,image:{src:"https:\u002F\u002Fimages.foxweather.com\u002Fstatic.foxweather.com\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fcontent\u002Fuploads\u002F2026\u002F09\u002F213\u002F120\u002Fscreenshot-2026-09-24-172526.png?ve=1&tl=1",width:t,height:u,sourceSet:[{src:"https:\u002F\u002Fimages.foxweather.com\u002Fstatic.foxweather.com\u002Fwww.foxweather.com\u002Fcontent\u002Fuploa